      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-11-30T22:43:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That says the discharge current loop is disabled when the charge current is 0. If you look at `raa489000_enable_linear_charge()` when linear charging is disabled, we set the charge current to be 0.\n\nTherefore, what\u0027s the issue? Is your concern while precharge is occcuring? If so, that\u0027s a known limitation with the part.",
      "parentUuid": "31eaa1fd_cfaf91f7",
      "revId": "634f55da7278b365366670729829ece3e2409060",
