        "id": 1293911
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-12-01T02:01:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "in ocpc phase\nhttps://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/refs/heads/firmware-dedede-13606.B-master/common/ocpc.c#388\nwill issue primary charger precharge current 256ma first.",
      "parentUuid": "ac862915_7c29bcb7",
      "revId": "634f55da7278b365366670729829ece3e2409060",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
