        "id": 1125984
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-12-01T17:29:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, but once precharge is complete it\u0027s set to 0mA. https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/refs/heads/firmware-dedede-13606.B-master/common/ocpc.c#420",
      "parentUuid": "4e89b3fb_eafbb88d",
      "revId": "634f55da7278b365366670729829ece3e2409060",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "37223016_0f355395",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1293911
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-12-02T02:08:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "But, this time 256mA -\u003e 0mA in primary charger, the primary typec-port will VBUS drop down and up, That\u0027s status connect -\u003e dis-connect(precharge) -\u003e connect(exit precharge). That will be abnormal behavior for end user. Why plug in sub-board w/ AC, will cause main board type-C device.",
      "parentUuid": "7af4ff99_cdbccfd7",
      "revId": "634f55da7278b365366670729829ece3e2409060",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "8c46738f_e771ecca",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
